#style @/docs/style.eds

:center: -- EEEch --
-- Character list --

00-0F Reserved for control
20    Space
21    Exclamation point
22    Double quote
23    Hashtag
24    Dollar
25    Percent
26    Ampersand
27    Single quote
28    Open parenthesis
29    Close parenthesis
2A    Asterisk
2B    Plus
2C    Comma
2D    Minus
2E    Period
2F    Forward Slash
30-39 Digits
3A    Colon
3B    Semi colon
3C    Less than
3D    Equals
3E    Greater than
3F    Questionmark

:reference: [eeech.eia]

:center: --- EEE Sees all ---